  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Argentina Preparatory Study</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This preparatory study intends to examine how we can develop a pilot project aimed at children and young people to become agents of change in their local community. We in RU and The 50 Percent aspire to develop a larger project with the local school &#x201c;Escuela Absal&#xf3;n Ibarra No 22,&#x201d; located in an under-resourced area of Santiago del Estero, a province in Northern Argentina. During this study, we will map what tools and skills are necessary for children to act for change by building upon the existing cooperation between the 50 Percent&#x2019;s local action group School of Citizenship and Escuela Absal&#xf3;n. Our future goal is to develop and implement programmes that empower children and young people as agents of change and systems transformation in their local community.</narrative>
  </description>
